WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
A brief opening close-up shows a woman before a bright transition.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.900
A person loads a black enclosed trailer with its rear ramp lowered, followed by a view of the trailer on a snowy driveway.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.650
A black enclosed trailer is shown outside a home in winter.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.650
A loaded dump trailer sits beside a pickup against a lake and mountain backdrop.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.750
A pickup tows a flatdeck trailer carrying long pipes along a lakeside road at dusk.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:32.500
A black and gold Tow-N-Go end card shows an enclosed trailer overlooking a lake. It reads, “Ready for what's next,” and lists enclosed, dump and flatdeck trailers, 778-215-3422 and towandgotrailers.ca. Additional text advertises trailer delivery, collection and loaded transport in Kelowna, the Okanagan and beyond.
